player_prompt.intro:
You are Player {player_id} in a 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. The match lasts {num_rounds} rounds.
Round structure:
• {conv_rounds} free-chat turns
• 1 decision turn - submit one token per opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' or '[<opp-id> defect]' (i.e. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; the default is 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (applied to each unordered pair):
  - Both cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Both defect     ->  {punishment}
  - You defect, they cooperate -> {temptation}
  - You cooperate, they defect -> {sucker}
The player(s) with the highest score at the end of all rounds wins.
